{
  "id": "reduckShopWatch",
  "name": "Shop watch, new and restocked products (Reduck)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shop watch: new and restocked products, with Reduck\n\nEvery few minutes, this workflow reads one listing page of a shop (a category, a brand or a franchise), and compares it with what it saw the time before. When a product is new, or comes back in stock, and its price is under your limit, it adds it to the cart and posts a message to a notification webhook, or only posts the message.\n\nThe Reduck node runs `reduck/king-jouet.com/list_products` and `reduck/king-jouet.com/add_to_cart` in your own Chrome, so the shop sees a normal visitor. Nothing is paid: you finish the order yourself. To order on your own, see the example **Alert to automatic purchase**.\n\nThe first run only records what the shop shows, and sends nothing. The memory of what was seen lives in the workflow, and n8n keeps it only for the **active** workflow: activate it, do not just test it.\n\nTo watch another shop, change the two script addresses and the arguments. The **Find What Changed** step reads the fields `ref`, `name`, `url`, `price` and `available_web`.\n\nBefore you activate it: set the **Config** values, and keep **Retry On Fail** off on **Add To Cart**.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d89a7d48-7f4a-5429-8250-a7c42c5bc659",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "17e7fa47-9e42-5a9f-a019-2370385de318",
      "name": "Trigger Every 5 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "listing_url",
              "name": "listing_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.king-jouet.com/jeux-jouets/jeux-societes/page1.htm"
            },
            {
              "id": "max_price",
              "name": "max_price",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "quantity",
              "name": "quantity",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "add_to_cart",
              "name": "add_to_cart",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "id": "notify_webhook",
              "name": "notify_webhook",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "193bc262-5b54-5176-8b6f-651ec5cb5396",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "script": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "address",
          "value": "reduck/king-jouet.com/list_products"
        },
        "args": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "url": "={{ $json.listing_url }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "url",
              "displayName": "url",
              "required": true,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            },
            {
              "id": "page",
              "displayName": "page",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "number",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "browser": "extension",
        "deviceId": "extension",
        "simplify": true
      },
      "id": "5a022d66-90aa-5dd9-90e0-cbe343cc8244",
      "name": "List Products",
      "type": "@reduck-ai/n8n-nodes-reduck.reduck",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {},
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Compares the listing with the one seen last time. New products, and products back on the web site, under max_price, go on.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst res = $input.first().json.result;\nif (!res || !Array.isArray(res.products)) throw new Error('The listing could not be read: ' + ($input.first().json.error ?? 'no result'));\nconst memory = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nconst before = memory.seen ?? null;\nconst now = {};\nfor (const p of res.products) now[p.ref] = p.available_web;\nmemory.seen = now;\nif (before === null) return []; // first run: only remember\nconst changed = res.products.filter((p) => p.available_web && (before[p.ref] === undefined || before[p.ref] === false));\nconst cheap = changed.filter((p) => p.price !== null && p.price <= cfg.max_price);\nreturn cheap.map((p) => ({ json: { ref: p.ref, name: p.name, url: p.url, price: p.price, is_new: before[p.ref] === undefined, tags: p.tags } }));"
      },
      "id": "99f9e025-f743-5d1f-84dc-aecbcb399a31",
      "name": "Find What Changed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f6364a2c-fd80-56f2-9bdc-9491e8c73344",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Config').first().json.add_to_cart }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dec97c9e-4f55-5439-b2f0-9df059703ff3",
      "name": "Add Automatically",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "script": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "address",
          "value": "reduck/king-jouet.com/add_to_cart"
        },
        "args": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "quantity": "={{ $('Config').first().json.quantity }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "url",
              "displayName": "url",
              "required": true,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            },
            {
              "id": "quantity",
              "displayName": "quantity",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "number",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "browser": "extension",
        "deviceId": "extension",
        "simplify": true
      },
      "id": "28eed23e-4bf8-5d81-93ad-f7cb64529dc9",
      "name": "Add To Cart",
      "type": "@reduck-ai/n8n-nodes-reduck.reduck",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {},
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.notify_webhook }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ content: ($('Find What Changed').item.json.is_new ? 'New: ' : 'Back in stock: ') + $('Find What Changed').item.json.name + ' at ' + $('Find What Changed').item.json.price + ' EUR. ' + ($json.result ? 'Added to your cart (' + $json.result.count + ' items, ' + $json.result.total + ' EUR). ' : 'It could not be added: ' + ($json.error ?? 'unknown error') + '. ') + $('Find What Changed').item.json.url }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "34487a75-e931-5cca-a9e4-c642c9030bc5",
      "name": "Notify Added",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.notify_webhook }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ content: ($json.is_new ? 'New: ' : 'Back in stock: ') + $json.name + ' at ' + $json.price + ' EUR. ' + $json.url }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "47e53544-e16d-5f95-9286-807edf038b9f",
      "name": "Notify Spotted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
